01:12:45,000 --> 01:12:51,000
Fistful of Vengeance is a 2022 American supernatural action thriller film directed by
Roel Reiné, and written by Cameron Litvack, Jessica Chou and Yalun Tu.

10
01:20:50,000 --> 01:20:56,000
The film serves as a follow-up to the first season of the television series Wu Assassins, and stars Iko Uwais, Lewis
Tan, Lawrence Kao, Rhatha Phongam,  JuJu Chan, Pearl Thusi, Francesca Corney, Jason Tobin and Simon Kuke.

11
